      "x": 564.0,
      "y": 963.0,
      "width": 672,
      "height": 83,
      "text": "ERROR RENDERING (uniform across all 3 surfaces - per nucleus_cli_spec.md Section 5.4)\n  [NE2007] NucleusResourceError: Out of memory while processing 'sales.fct_orders' (~5GB).\n           fix_hint: add a partition filter, increase machine memory, or use compute=databricks.\n           docs:    nucleus.dev/errors/resource\nSame NE-code. Same user_message. Same fix_hint. No DuckDB or Dagster classnames anywhere.",
